			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to invalidate</i>,
				<i>refute</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">calumnias,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 327</span></i>
			.</div>
